<title>BRAZIL: TABLE - Brazil's Cesp H1 loss shrinks.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Brazil's Cesp H1 loss shrinks.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state-owned power utility Companhia Energetica de Sao Paulo (Cesp) released the following first-half 1997 financial results.</p>
<p>		    Jan-June 1997	   Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Loss		  109.6 million	   293 million</p>
<p>    Loss/1,000 Shrs   1.17 reais		3.13 reais</p>
<p>    Net Sales	   1.307 billion	   1.153 billion</p>
<p>    Gross Sales	 1.996 billion	   1.767 billion</p>
<p>    Oper Profit	 415.7 million	   325.2 million</p>
<p>    Net Worth	   12.98 billion	   12.59 billion</p>
<p>Note: Figures are in Brazilian reais and are not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>((--James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
